{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.poster.avif?t=1754001338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.webm?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.mp4?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRACKED</strong> is a fast-paced, 3D PvP roguelike where glass-headed mages go head-to-head (or head-to-shards) in chaotic arena duels. Inspired by <i>Rounds</i> and powered by physics-based combat, every fight is unpredictable, explosive, and wildly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up in 1v1, 2v1, or 2v2 showdowns. After every round, choose from a pool of powerful, quirky upgrades that stack into outrageous builds \u2014 from homing fireballs and knockback shockwaves to rapid-fire chaos or debilitating hexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two fights are the same. No glass head survives forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.poster.avif?t=1754001338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.webm?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.mp4?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Team-based Brawling:</strong> Battle it out in 1v1, 2v1, or 2v2 matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Glass Heads Will Roll:</strong> Shatter your enemies in intense physics-driven wizard fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Build Your Madness:</strong> Stack upgrades each round and create broken, over-the-top combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Fast &amp; Fluid Rounds:</strong> Jump into short, explosive matches with zero downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller &amp; Online Ready:</strong> Built for online competitive fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.poster.avif?t=1754001338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.webm?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.mp4?t=1754001338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917010?t=1754001338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/3807d7370c8c8f4686765a5b3a4c3d6af4e900d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754001338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/07026281e561bfc7f0b26f318fd41032c8d519e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754001338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/07026281e561bfc7f0b26f318fd41032c8d519e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754001338","categories":[{"description":"Multi